        "content": "## Discord AI Assistant\n\nReceives messages from Discord bot and responds using AI.\n\n**Webhook:** `/webhook/discord-updates`\n\n**Features:**\n- Conversational AI using llama.cpp (OpenAI-compatible API)\n- Per-user conversation memory\n- Tool: Check Docker updates via existing workflow\n- Tool: Fetch changelogs from GitHub releases\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Configure OpenAI credentials with dummy API key (uses baseURL override)\n2. Ensure Docker Update Checker workflow is active\n3. Activate this workflow",
